WEBVTT

00:01.800 --> 00:06.480
The second son Xu with fine qualities and heroic bearing, capable of bearing the divine mandate.

00:06.560 --> 00:12.160
Should ascend to the imperial throne all ministers at home and abroad should assist with one heart.

00:12.240 --> 00:15.480
All matters, internal and external, should follow ancestral institutions.

00:16.320 --> 00:18.240
Do not fail my trust.

